        "text": "Language help"
      },
      {
        "y": 508.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 275.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Some people think we should return to an"
      },
      {
        "y": 520.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 483.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "emphasis on the three Rs, the traditional, Notice how compound adjectives like well-off,"
      },
      {
        "y": 532.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 519.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "basic skills. [reading, writing and arithmetic] well-endowed, high-achieving, badly-performing can be"
      },
      {
        "y": 544.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 523.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Literacy and numeracy are skills no one used in comparative and superlative forms, e.g. better-off,"
      },
      {
        "y": 556.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 507.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "can afford to be without. [the ability to read] best-endowed, higher-achieving, worst-performing."
      },
      {
        "y": 569.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 240.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "[the ability to count / do basic maths]"
      },
      {
        "y": 580.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 251.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Curriculum reform is often done for"
      },
      {
        "y": 592.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 331.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "political reasons rather than for good educational ones."
      },
      {
        "y": 604.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 417.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "[changes to what is covered in the national syllabus = plan of what is to be studied]"
      },
      {
        "y": 616.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 530.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Nowadays, lifelong/continuing education is an issue, and creating opportunities for mature students"
      },
      {
        "y": 628.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 422.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "is important. [education for all ages] [adult students older than the average student]"
      },
      {
        "y": 640.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 512.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Special needs education is expensive because class sizes need to be small or one-to-one. [education for"
      },
      {
        "y": 653.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 537,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "children who cannot learn in the normal way, because they have some disability] [one teacher and one pupil, not a group]"
      },
      {
        "y": 664.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 435.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Children are unhappy at school if there is a lot of bullying. [threatening behaviour]"
      },
      {
        "y": 676.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 525.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Some headteachers complain that getting to grips with constant new government guidelines on what"
      },
      {
        "y": 688.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 521.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "schools should be doing is a distraction from what they ought to be focusing on. [advice (often official)"
      },
      {
        "y": 701.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 319,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "on how something should be done] [takes attention away]"
      }
